caption: Oaths

Oaths: All who are consecrated to Father Sky must follow a basic code: Never stab a buddy in the back (fair duels are ok), share the spoils with your buddies, never give useful information to the enemy. Many priests of Father Sky also take an oath to Wear No Armor.
